ll,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106493","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106493","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106493.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106493.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-20T16:39:44Z"},"body":"This PR settles on a hybrid of what the previous system for embedding light count into specializations constants was and opts for an approach where each of these counts is turned into an enum instead.\r\n- Direct Light Count\r\n- Omni Light Count\r\n- Spot Light Count\r\n- Reflection Probe Count\r\n\r\nThese counts now instead are 2-bit values with 3 possible states:\r\n- Zero\r\n- One\r\n- Up to 8\r\n\r\nDecals are also considered but turned into a boolean instead to indicate there's either no decals or up to 8 decals.\r\n\r\n[TPS Demo from here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90284)\r\n\r\nAverage GPU Time in Mali-G78\r\n- `master`: ~25.1ms\r\n- `mobile-scs-permutations`: ~24.6ms\r\n\r\nSpecialized Pipelines\r\n- `master`: 240 specialized pipelines\r\n- `mobile-scs-permutations`: 131 specialized pipelines\r\n\r\nThe demo in particular makes heavy use of different types of lights, probes and decals, which should be pretty indicative of an expensive scenario.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs",